flowchart LR
    C[Customer payment app] -->|Scan and verify static/dynamic QR| O[Originating Institution or Transaction Originator]
    M[Merchant] -->|Presents QR and amount| C
    R[Receiving Institution / Merchant Bank] -->|Generates merchant QR| M
    O -->|OAuth 1.0a signed Payment API request| MC[Mastercard MPQR API]
    MC -->|Routes payment transaction| R
    R -->|Approves/declines and credits merchant account| MC
    MC -->|Payment response| O
    O -->|Customer outcome| C
    O -->|Retrieval when UNKNOWN/PENDING| MC

    S[SmartGen checkout application] -->|Internal order + amount only| W[SmartGen Cloudflare Worker]
    W -->|Server-side OAuth 1.0a| MC
    W -->|Normalized status| S
    W --> DB[(SmartGen order and audit store)]
    DB --> ADM[Admin dashboard and reconciliation]

    subgraph Environments
      SB[Sandbox: simulated responses]
      MTF[MTF: production-like test]
      PR[Production: approved live processing]
    end
    W -. configured per environment .-> SB
    W -. configured per environment .-> MTF
    W -. configured per environment .-> PR
